Large data export

A tenant just completed an export above the alert threshold for their account.
This is informational. No action is required unless the pattern looks wrong.

Tenant:          <%= @company&.name %> (ID <%= @job.company_id %>)
User:            <%= @user&.email %> (ID <%= @job.user_id %>)
Module:          <%= @job.module_type %>
Format:          <%= @job.format.upcase %>
Rows:            <%= @job.row_count %>
Fields:          <%= @job.selected_fields.size %>
Filters:         <%= @job.filters.presence || 'none (full table)' %>
Requested from:  <%= @job.requested_ip %>
Acknowledged at: <%= @job.acknowledged_at %>
Watermark:       <%= @job.watermark_token %>
Export job:      #<%= @job.id %>

Every row in the delivered file carries the watermark above in an export_ref
column, so this file stays attributable to this job.
